| 4 | MAJOR | §5.6; §8.1 | \(S'=E_\nu\psi'\) is not exact for the stated measure with its zero boundary atom. The proof itself introduces a nonzero correction \(B'\). | Carry boundary and exceptional corrections through centering and OPV. |
